{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3640","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3640","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3640\",\"parent_revision\":\"001533d48e54aa7daca4c9d38dcd907fd7f1a651282cd2430fa0bb50cd3e99ed\",\"root_revision\":\"001533d48e54aa7daca4c9d38dcd907fd7f1a651282cd2430fa0bb50cd3e99ed\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- All affected packages are inventoried before remediation begins.\\n- Every alert has a documented remediation or an evidence-backed disposition.\\n- Relevant tests and dependency validation pass after upgrades.\\n- Remaining alert counts and reasons are recorded.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Problem\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nThe latest push evidence reported 30 open default-branch dependency alerts: 3 critical, 19 high, and 8 moderate. These alerts require explicit ownership separate from runtime-integrity initiative #3620.\\n\\nDependabot alerts: https://github.com/Jamie-BitFlight/claude_skills/security/dependabot\\n</div>\\n\\n## Live Inventory Gate\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nThe push counts are observed evidence, not a remediation inventory. Query the live Dependabot alert inventory immediately before any remediation; record timestamp, alert IDs, package/manifests, dependency paths, advisories, severity, and fixed versions. Stop if live access is unavailable or counts differ until the discrepancy is recorded.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Required Work\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- Inventory every affected package and manifest before attempting remediation.\\n- After a live Dependabot inventory, map every observed alert to the affected package, dependency path, advisory, severity, and available fixed version.\\n- Group compatible upgrades and identify breaking-change or test risks.\\n- Apply and verify remediations without suppressing unresolved alerts.\\n- Reconcile the final alert counts against the Dependabot page.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"bce8f8dddb646cde8966a07d7c741d4675b0cd75449f7a12721d056a9918acc8\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABWNedBw\"}"}